eactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23543-penguinbowler","name":"Penguinbowler","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-01T15:48:16-07:00","id":1309304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1307874-upcoming-changeling-the-lost-interview-with-developer-meghan-fitzgerald?p=1308150#post1308150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Very cool. Can eidola be removed from the Bastion in which they were created in? And if they are not present, can they survive past the destruction of said bastion?<br /> <br /> ie. is there a way for an eidolon to escape a dream before it ends and live?</div> </div> </div> </div> This is extra important question because True Fae can create Eidolons in the Hedge and I'm not sure how to treat that mechanically. <br /> <br /> Also can she give us an idea of what Kiths are in Kith and Kin and what Courts and Entitlements are in the Companion. Are seperate Eldrich Entitlements still a thing compared to Noble Entitlements?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-01T15:49:27-07:00","id":1309305,"title":"","content":"Does that Companion give us the Toronto Freehold?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-01T15:52:02-07:00","id":1309308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1307874-upcoming-changeling-the-lost-interview-with-developer-meghan-fitzgerald#post1307874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello,<br /> <br /> We are pleased to announce that we have an upcoming interview coming with Meghan Fitzgerald. We'll be talking about Changeling the Lost 2nd Edition. We're soliciting additional questions from you folks on the forums. We'll talk about Meghan's experience working on CtL2 along with design decisions and story ideas, but we'd like to include additional specific questions about the game.</div> </div> </div> </div> Will you put the link to the interview in this thread when it's ready?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","v